  "decision_rules": [
    "If factual support is insufficient, choose WAIT.",
    "Never create, estimate or modify price levels.",
    "Never rewrite deterministic level interaction states.",
    "Never cite a signal or source whose usable flag is false.",
    "BREAKOUT, RETEST_PENDING or RETEST alone cannot justify ENTER.",
